      ],
      "source": "https://www.clintonwi.us/history"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Clinton's historical society presents the diverse histories of the village and the surrounding Turtle, La Prairie, and Bradford Townships.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.clintonwi.us/history"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Clinton's community historical society encourages people of all ages to participate in creating oral history recordings and collecting artifacts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.clintonwi.us/history"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Many long-term residents continue to live in Clinton, contributing to the heart of the local community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
